    "finalName": "",
    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>, you can designate one ally and make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check, comparing the result against the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a> of all enemies in your line of sight who can hear and understand you. If your check result equals or exceeds a target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>, that target cannot attack the ally you designated until the beginning of your next turn.<br><br>Characters that use this Talent or the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Draw_Fire\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Draw Fire\"><b>Draw Fire</b></a> Talent cannot be targeted by or benefit from this Talent. You may not benefit from this Talent at the same time as the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Misplaced_Loyalty\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Misplaced Loyalty\"><b>Misplaced Loyalty</b></a> Talent.",
